    LLM: 'Try to win tricks that contain 10s. Save high cards for tricks where 10s are played. Communicate with your partner through card play.\n\nTrack which 10s have been played. Force opponents to use high cards on non-10 tricks. Set up situations where you can capture multiple 10s.\n\nCard counting is essential. Track all high cards to know when your cards are unbeatable. Coordinate with partner to ensure coverage of all suits.',
